  "description": "The Innokin Klypse Pro Pod Kit is a premium MTL vaping device that combines style, performance, and ease of use. Built with a durable aluminium alloy and PCTG body, this sleek device houses a powerful 1000mAh built-in battery, offering a wattage range of 6-25W to suit your vaping preferences. The Klypse Pro features a user-friendly side-fill system for its refillable pods, which come with different resistance options to tailor your vaping experience. The adjustable airflow allows for precise control over your draw, whether you prefer a tighter or looser MTL vape. The device includes a magnetic pod connection for secure attachment and effortless pod swaps. Charging the device is quick and convenient with the DC5.0V/1A USB-C fast charging port. Featuring a hidden side screen, users can easily monitor their settings discreetly, while the intuitive LED battery indicator keeps you informed of your battery status, ensuring you're never caught off guard. Discover vape liquids online crafted to pair seamlessly with this kit. We Recommend Paring this kit with 50/50 , Nic Salts or High PG E-Liquids. Please note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil. How to set up the INNOKIN Klypse Pro Pod Vape Kit",
